1
00:00:00,960 --> 00:00:02,900
Everybody serves
a master.

2
00:00:03,180 --> 00:00:06,500
Most people never find
out who theirs is —

3
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:10,100
until money asks
them to choose.

4
00:00:10,620 --> 00:00:12,600
Money is a
great servant.

5
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:15,600
And a terrible god.

6
00:00:16,020 --> 00:00:19,800
The first question
was never "How much
do I have?"

7
00:00:20,160 --> 00:00:22,200
It is —
"Whose is it?"

8
00:00:22,660 --> 00:00:23,700
OWNERSHIP.

9
00:00:23,820 --> 00:00:24,600
FAITHFULNESS.

10
00:00:24,720 --> 00:00:25,900
MASTERY.

11
00:00:26,020 --> 00:00:27,300
MULTIPLICATION.

12
00:00:27,700 --> 00:00:28,900
Be faithful
in the little.

13
00:00:29,160 --> 00:00:31,900
Don't bury what He
puts in your hands.

14
00:00:32,320 --> 00:00:36,600
Welcome to The
Stewardship Code —
Principles of
Managing Money.
